This implementation creates a simple Rails API application that listens for POST requests at the `/decideUnsubscribe` endpoint. It checks the body of the request for unsubscribe keywords and extracts the email address from the "From" field of the raw email text. The response is a JSON object indicating whether the user should be unsubscribed and includes the user's email address. 

Make sure to run the Rails server using the command `bin/rails server --binding 0.0.0.0 --port 5000` to start the application.
